KG42.register("clusters-745330c5965317fb57c8f9b3",{"id":"29-smart_home_trading::v142-d-CL002","paper":"29-smart_home_trading","label":"Household mutual-trading permission and the surplus-energy trading time limit in the no-storage case","record":{"cluster_id":"v142-d-CL002","label":"Household mutual-trading permission and the surplus-energy trading time limit in the no-storage case","market_meaning":"Households in a microgrid already possessing P2P capability may trade with one another. In a case without household storage where surplus energy appears in a certain time slot, if the surplus energy is used for microgrid trading, it must be sold in that time slot; failure to sell it will limit further cost reduction. This cluster retains the trading permission and the conditional time limit and does not claim to guarantee that all surplus energy is transacted.","mechanism_ids":["v141-a-M01"],"market_types":["LEM"],"process_stages":["activation"],"scope_disposition":"conditional","scope_explanation":"The general household mutual-trading permission applies to an already formed P2P microgrid; the same-time-slot requirement applies only to the evaluated case without storage and cannot be generalized to scenarios with storage or interpreted as a universal mandatory electricity-sale obligation for all households.","assembly_status":"assembled","boundary_rationale":"Under the disclosed conditions, this chain independently expresses tradable entities, trading activity, and time restriction. The whole chain retains its general permission and case condition, does not incorporate the case time limit into general storage optimization, and does not infer dependency edges from clearing to physical execution from narrative order.","chain_bindings":[{"chain_id":"v141-c-R004","ownership":"primary","role":"core","rationale":"The only item undertaking the household mutual-trading permission and the conditional statement that, without storage, surplus energy is traded in the same time slot."}],"connections":[],"object_mappings":[],"gaps":[{"gap_id":"v142-d-CL002-G001","category":"unverified_source","description":"The trading permission comes from the introduction, and the no-storage time limit comes from the case discussion; the related B evidence is all unverified. assembled in this cluster only means that these frozen records can form the stated conditional candidate, not that they have been independently verified or that physical execution guarantees exist.","chain_ids":["v141-c-R004"],"object_refs":["v141-c-R004::phi::v141-c-R004-C001","v141-c-R004::phi::v141-c-R004-C002"],"evidence_ids":["v141-b-g01-E02","v141-b-g01-E03","v141-b-g02-E35","v141-b-g03-E09"],"proposal_ids":[],"required_work":"Manually check the original context of the general permission and the case time limit and confirm the conditional interpretation; if it is to be extended to scheduling execution or mandatory transaction rules, separate source basis and upstream chains are required."}]},"rule_refs":["29-smart_home_trading::v141-c-R004"],"unresolved_rule_refs":[],"node_ids":["KG40-e988fed52eadab03"]});
